Description: 
    Provides a framework to identify and validate gene or transcript expression signatures associated with patient survival.
    The method combines penalized Cox regression (LASSO) with a bootstrap-based multivariate approach to improve robustness in feature selection.
    Additional statistical filtering steps and visualization tools are included.
